@startuml SD-29-approve-leave-request
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor black
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBorderColor black
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor white
skinparam EntityBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceReferenceBorderColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam dpi 150
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 12
autonumber
title SD-29: Approve Leave Request (UC-09)
' Traces: UC-09; FR-24, FR-25, FR-64, FR-66, FR-70
' Sources: DEC-13, DEC-51, DEC-55, DEC-56; sequence-diagram-review.md.
control ":Request\nController" as RQ
control ":Roster\nController" as RC
control ":Notification\nService" as NS
entity ":Leave Request" as LR
entity ":Audit Log" as AL

[-> RQ ++ : approveLeave(request)
RQ -> RQ : findCrewsOn(staff, dates)
opt existing Crew affected
  RQ -->] : Crew warning for Manager (FR-24)
  [-> RQ : confirm(choice)
end
alt Manager cancels
  RQ -->] : unchanged
else confirmed / no Crew affected
  RQ -> RQ : checkStillPending(request)
  alt request changed while confirming
    RQ -->] : current status; no second decision
  else still Pending
    group atomic approval save
      RQ -> LR : approve()
      RQ -> AL : record(Manager, Leave approved)
    end
    opt existing Crew affected
      RQ -> RC : handleCrewInvalidation(staff, dates)
      ref over RC : SD-16
      RC --> RQ : Van-days flagged
    end
    RQ -> NS : notify(LeaveApproved, requester)
    ref over NS : SD-15
    NS --> RQ : delivery recorded
    RQ -->] : Approved
  end
end
deactivate RQ
legend bottom
The warning/confirmation gates connect to the Manager via
RequestReviewPage in SD-09.
Approval deducts working days and makes Staff unavailable
(FR-24/25). FR-70 keeps the Van Jobs.
Failed save retains Pending and prior data (NFR-09).
endlegend
@enduml
